1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 6)

3
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,533
Hello Mr. Shen.

4
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,400
Hello.

5
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:01,500
My last name is Chen,

6
00:02:01,633 --> 00:02:03,733
I'm the lawyer Mr. Ji hired

7
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:04,833
I asked you here today

8
00:02:04,866 --> 00:02:05,899
because we need to

9
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:07,633
sort out your contract with Mr. Ji.

10
00:02:09,066 --> 00:02:12,500
Ji Mingxuan won't even
handle a breakup himself.

11
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,633
He just sent a lawyer to talk to me.

12
00:02:15,733 --> 00:02:16,733
Maybe

13
00:02:16,933 --> 00:02:18,000
to Ji Mingxuan

14
00:02:18,733 --> 00:02:20,833
it was just a contract all along.

15
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,673
Now that the contract's void,

16
00:02:23,566 --> 00:02:25,866
of course it should be
settled the proper way.

17
00:02:29,532 --> 00:02:32,133
How's Miss Ji doing lately? Do you know?

18
00:02:32,133 --> 00:02:33,133
Mm.

19
00:02:33,333 --> 00:02:35,466
Her condition is pretty stable now.

20
00:02:35,633 --> 00:02:36,633
Seems like

21
00:02:36,833 --> 00:02:39,000
Mr. Ji is taking Miss Ji
abroad for treatment.

22
00:02:41,033 --> 00:02:42,033
It's good that she's stable.

23
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,500
Mr. Shen.

24
00:02:46,059 --> 00:02:48,693
According to the agreements
you signed with Mr. Ji over the years,

25
00:02:49,419 --> 00:02:51,253
this is what you should be getting.

26
00:02:51,446 --> 00:02:53,279
[Shen Mo is getting MULTIPLE
properties as part of the agreement]

27
00:02:53,433 --> 00:02:55,533
Mr. Ji is really generous.

28
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:57,900
Mr. Ji is always like that.

29
00:02:59,566 --> 00:03:01,566
Ji Mingxuan truly lives
up to being a businessman.

30
00:03:02,033 --> 00:03:04,700
Even feelings come with a price tag.

31
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:08,400
Should I just sign here?

32
00:03:08,433 --> 00:03:08,733
Mm.

33
00:03:08,733 --> 00:03:09,433
Yes.

34
00:03:09,653 --> 00:03:12,819
Also, Mr. Ji said, if you
have any other questions,

35
00:03:12,843 --> 00:03:14,219
feel free to bring them up anytime.

36
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:18,732
But this villa is where Miss Ji grew up.

37
00:03:19,432 --> 00:03:20,232
I understand.

38
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,865
I'll move out in a few days.

39
00:03:21,866 --> 00:03:22,866
Mm.

40
00:03:23,266 --> 00:03:24,533
Mr. Ji is always generous.

41
00:03:24,666 --> 00:03:27,132
Several properties have great layouts.

42
00:03:27,133 --> 00:03:28,366
Once the paperwork is done

43
00:03:28,566 --> 00:03:30,633
Mr. Shen, you can move back anytime.

44
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,666
For someone who got kicked out,

45
00:03:35,333 --> 00:03:37,033
I'm staying pretty calm, right?

46
00:03:37,652 --> 00:03:38,952
Maybe because...

47
00:03:39,666 --> 00:03:42,533
Ji Mingxuan and I never really started.

48
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:44,900
Maybe it's for the best.

49
00:03:45,633 --> 00:03:46,633
Oh, right

50
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:49,800
Mr. Ji said the things
he gave you back then.

51
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,700
Of course they're all yours.

52
00:03:51,833 --> 00:03:54,766
But there's one thing he wants back.

53
00:03:57,833 --> 00:03:58,833
What is it?

54
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,333
It's the house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

55
00:04:02,466 --> 00:04:03,666
Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

56
00:04:05,633 --> 00:04:08,887
Mr. Shen, you're living at the
house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa, right?

57
00:04:09,633 --> 00:04:11,566
Why bring this up all
of a sudden, Mr. Zhao?

58
00:04:12,433 --> 00:04:13,433
Nothing.

59
00:04:13,633 --> 00:04:14,873
I mistook you for someone else.

60
00:04:15,566 --> 00:04:17,526
Mr. Ji insisted on going
to Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

61
00:04:17,833 --> 00:04:19,700
But the rain last night was so heavy.

62
00:04:20,733 --> 00:04:22,733
Mr. Ji was so drunk he
couldn't even walk straight.

63
00:04:23,166 --> 00:04:24,466
But he still wanted to go.

64
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:28,661
I always thought another lover of Ji
Mingxuan lived at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

65
00:04:29,433 --> 00:04:32,433
But now it's somehow
property under my name.

66
00:04:33,833 --> 00:04:36,066
Could you give me the
key to Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

67
00:04:36,166 --> 00:04:37,242
I want to take another look.

68
00:04:37,266 --> 00:04:38,266
Ah.

69
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,966
Since it's a gift from Mr. Ji,

70
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,799
then the key must be with you.

71
00:04:43,823 --> 00:04:44,982
It's with me?

72
00:04:45,052 --> 00:04:46,052
Yeah.

73
00:04:47,333 --> 00:04:48,666
It's fine, Mr. Shen.

74
00:04:48,866 --> 00:04:49,866
You can look again.

75
00:04:50,466 --> 00:04:51,732
Once you've thought it over

76
00:04:51,733 --> 00:04:52,733
I'll come find you again.

77
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,500
Then I'll take my leave, Mr. Shen.

78
00:04:56,533 --> 00:04:57,600
Let's keep in touch.

79
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,300
Take care.

80
00:04:58,366 --> 00:04:59,366
Mm.

81
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:01,333
My memories from three
years ago are such a mess.

82
00:06:01,833 --> 00:06:03,433
Seems like not long after that

83
00:06:04,033 --> 00:06:05,866
the landlord kicked me out.

84
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:07,900
Then Mr. Ji took me in.

85
00:06:07,933 --> 00:06:09,000
Signed a contract.

86
00:06:10,119 --> 00:06:11,986
So what's this house then?

87
00:06:12,833 --> 00:06:14,033
A down payment?

88
00:06:52,700 --> 00:06:54,166
How long until the plane flies?

89
00:06:55,466 --> 00:06:56,233
Plenty of time.

90
00:06:56,266 --> 00:06:57,266
We'll make it.

91
00:07:05,333 --> 00:07:06,900
This was once our home.

92
00:07:14,956 --> 00:07:19,703
(It's my fault, I'll make amends -Shen Mo)

93
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,000
This guy.

94
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,600
How many times have I told you?

95
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,733
You can't even handle such a small thing.

96
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,666
Sorry, boss

97
00:07:34,866 --> 00:07:36,200
I don't care what they say.

98
00:07:37,666 --> 00:07:39,366
We must win this project.

99
00:07:40,166 --> 00:07:41,166
No matter what.

100
00:07:41,533 --> 00:07:42,533
Understood, boss.

101
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,233
Did you hear what I said?

102
00:07:47,333 --> 00:07:48,333
Excuse me.

103
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:56,900
I'm so sorry.

104
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:58,900
Did I bump into you?

105
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:01,900
I'm fine.

106
00:08:02,066 --> 00:08:03,066
That's good.

107
00:08:04,433 --> 00:08:05,433
Ah.

108
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,933
My art supplies I just bought...!

109
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,165
Hey, don't laugh

110
00:08:10,189 --> 00:08:11,656
I was just trying to avoid you.

111
00:08:18,166 --> 00:08:20,200
Oh no.

112
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,233
I scratched someone's car.

113
00:08:24,366 --> 00:08:26,033
How much is that gonna cost?

114
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:33,566
This car looks pretty expensive.

115
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,333
How expensive?

116
00:08:40,933 --> 00:08:42,400
The really expensive kind.

117
00:08:50,266 --> 00:08:51,533
What do I do now?

118
00:08:58,133 --> 00:08:59,133
Bro.

119
00:09:01,500 --> 00:09:03,133
Give me one too.

120
00:09:06,633 --> 00:09:07,633
Thanks, bro.

121
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:42,700
You don't even smoke, why do you want one?

122
00:09:43,333 --> 00:09:45,166
Don't they say smoking eases your worries?

123
00:09:45,933 --> 00:09:47,200
Doesn't seem to help.

124
00:09:48,433 --> 00:09:49,433
Alright.

125
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,600
Go home, quick.

126
00:09:54,033 --> 00:09:55,033
Hey.

127
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,300
What do you mean by that?

128
00:09:56,726 --> 00:09:58,159
I, Shen Mo, may not have money,

129
00:09:58,366 --> 00:09:59,886
but I'm not that kind of person, okay?

130
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,366
I won't run away.

131
00:10:04,466 --> 00:10:05,566
So what's your plan?

132
00:10:10,233 --> 00:10:11,233
Got a pen and paper?

133
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:26,103
(It's my fault, I'll make amends -Shen Mo)

134
00:10:27,066 --> 00:10:28,066
Here you go.

135
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:31,700
Ah.

136
00:10:31,701 --> 00:10:32,733
What bad luck.

137
00:10:35,665 --> 00:10:37,065
Can you help hold it?

138
00:10:39,033 --> 00:10:40,033
Thanks.

139
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:55,700
What?

140
00:11:08,266 --> 00:11:09,266
I'm heading off then.

141
00:11:11,633 --> 00:11:13,033
Watch where you're going next time.

142
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:15,700
Oh.

143
00:11:16,533 --> 00:11:17,533
I won't run.

144
00:11:18,333 --> 00:11:19,333
I'll pay you back.

145
00:11:42,500 --> 00:11:43,533
Shen Mo.

146
00:11:51,533 --> 00:11:52,533
Bro.

147
00:11:52,633 --> 00:11:53,633
An'an.

148
00:11:56,333 --> 00:11:57,100
Get in the car.

149
00:11:57,133 --> 00:11:58,166
Let's go eat.

150
00:11:58,266 --> 00:11:59,266
Okay.

151
00:11:59,433 --> 00:12:00,465
Did you see that just now?

152
00:12:00,466 --> 00:12:01,576
Some student, no idea what happened.

153
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,765
All flustered.

154
00:12:02,766 --> 00:12:03,766
So ridiculous.

155
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:05,633
I saw.

156
00:12:05,853 --> 00:12:06,853
That guy...

157
00:12:07,833 --> 00:12:08,833
his name is Shen Mo.

158
00:12:13,533 --> 00:12:14,533
An'an.

159
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:15,600
You're graduating soon.

160
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:16,766
What are your plans?

161
00:12:17,633 --> 00:12:18,633
Me?

162
00:12:19,233 --> 00:12:21,000
I want to go to the UK for grad school.

163
00:12:21,333 --> 00:12:23,166
My offer is coming any day now.

164
00:12:24,066 --> 00:12:25,133
Oh, that's easy.

165
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:29,733
Bro.

166
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:31,100
There's something else.

167
00:12:32,133 --> 00:12:33,133
Oh.

168
00:12:33,766 --> 00:12:37,366
I want to go to grad school with Zhou Yang.

169
00:12:40,466 --> 00:12:41,794
Zhou Yang, of The Zhou Family?

170
00:12:41,819 --> 00:12:42,819
Yeah.

171
00:12:43,766 --> 00:12:46,433
He's the only guy I've liked my whole life.

172
00:12:46,866 --> 00:12:47,666
Bro.

173
00:12:47,690 --> 00:12:50,024
Just say yes to us going
to the UK together, please?

174
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:53,173
Have you already talked
it over with Zhou Yang?

175
00:12:53,610 --> 00:12:57,000
No, I just wanted to
get your OK first, big bro.

176
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,100
Mm.

177
00:13:00,700 --> 00:13:01,700
I see.

178
00:13:09,433 --> 00:13:11,166
I know what the Zhou Family is after.

179
00:13:11,266 --> 00:13:14,059
They've been wanting to meet
you to talk about a business marriage.

180
00:13:14,259 --> 00:13:16,259
I don't care about business,

181
00:13:16,466 --> 00:13:19,300
I only care if Yang can make An'an happy.

182
00:13:20,233 --> 00:13:21,233
Understood.

183
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,600
The key is Yang himself.

184
00:13:24,233 --> 00:13:25,600
Dig up everything on him.

185
00:13:25,933 --> 00:13:27,866
Who he's dealt with, what he's been up to.

186
00:13:29,133 --> 00:13:30,333
You know what I mean.

187
00:13:30,866 --> 00:13:32,333
Rest assured, Mr. Ji.

188
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,865
Morning document review
and key tasks for the day.

189
00:13:45,866 --> 00:13:47,332
Quarterly report on the offshore fund.

190
00:13:47,333 --> 00:13:49,266
Haiyue new energy project review meeting.

191
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:49,833
Alright.

192
00:13:49,866 --> 00:13:50,266
Human resources...

193
00:13:50,833 --> 00:13:51,500
I got it.

194
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:52,500
That's all.

195
00:13:53,066 --> 00:13:54,699
Also, the school leaders at T University

196
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:56,366
invited you to their event again.

197
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,120
Should I decline them again this time?

198
00:13:59,633 --> 00:14:00,633
T University?

199
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,033
When is it?

200
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,000
They said it's up to your schedule.

201
00:14:08,833 --> 00:14:10,433
If the timing works out...

202
00:14:11,833 --> 00:14:13,100
I could go.

203
00:14:14,066 --> 00:14:15,066
Okay.

204
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,133
Not a good idea out here.

205
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,366
What?

206
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:41,533
Are you shy?

207
00:14:46,666 --> 00:14:47,266
Ah.

208
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:48,300
What are you doing?

209
00:14:55,366 --> 00:14:56,466
Not out in public.

210
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:57,800
What if someone sees us?

211
00:15:01,433 --> 00:15:02,433
Okay.

212
00:15:02,766 --> 00:15:05,733
You're the eldest son of the Zhou
family, I know your identity is special.

213
00:15:13,233 --> 00:15:14,233
Xiao Mo.

214
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,600
You're about to graduate.

215
00:15:17,833 --> 00:15:19,000
Any plans?

216
00:15:21,033 --> 00:15:22,366
Not sure yet.

217
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:24,700
I definitely want to keep painting.

218
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:27,933
But I've also sent out a few resumes.

219
00:15:28,086 --> 00:15:29,366
Just taking it one step at a time.

220
00:15:31,533 --> 00:15:32,533
Mm.

221
00:15:33,833 --> 00:15:35,233
Why are you asking all of a sudden?

222
00:15:37,733 --> 00:15:38,733
Nothing.

223
00:15:39,366 --> 00:15:40,166
No.

224
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:41,300
Something's up.

225
00:15:41,533 --> 00:15:42,533
Spill it.

226
00:15:45,533 --> 00:15:46,533
Me?

227
00:15:46,766 --> 00:15:50,000
I'm just scared you'll
be too busy for me later.

228
00:15:50,833 --> 00:15:51,900
Who knows?

229
00:15:53,466 --> 00:15:54,732
I'm such a great painter.

230
00:15:54,733 --> 00:15:56,633
One day I'll be a famous artist.

231
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,633
You'd better start sucking up to me now.

232
00:15:59,933 --> 00:16:00,933
Okay.

233
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,200
My great artist.

234
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,500
Alright.

235
00:16:05,333 --> 00:16:06,066
It's getting late.

236
00:16:06,100 --> 00:16:07,366
We should head back to school.

237
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,200
Let's go.

238
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:16,600
Mr. Ji, you're truly a rising star

239
00:16:16,866 --> 00:16:17,733
I hope that in the future.

240
00:16:17,734 --> 00:16:20,233
The Ji Group can work
more with our T University.

241
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,000
You flatter me.

242
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:23,300
T University is full of talent

243
00:16:23,633 --> 00:16:24,733
I also hope

244
00:16:25,333 --> 00:16:27,400
you'll send more talent
our way to the Ji Group.

245
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:28,500
That's for sure.

246
00:16:29,229 --> 00:16:32,041
[A very flattering headshot of Shen Mo
featuring his various artistic accomplishments.]

247
00:16:32,065 --> 00:16:33,065
This is...?

248
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,566
He's a good kid.

249
00:16:36,033 --> 00:16:36,966
Art major.

250
00:16:37,033 --> 00:16:38,433
His family's not well off.

251
00:16:38,666 --> 00:16:42,066
If he keeps painting, I
can't say he'll be a great painter,

252
00:16:42,233 --> 00:16:44,066
but he'll definitely
make a name for himself.

253
00:16:45,233 --> 00:16:46,600
Didn't expect him to be this good.

254
00:16:47,033 --> 00:16:48,333
You know Mo?

255
00:16:49,366 --> 00:16:50,366
No.

256
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:51,500
Just happened to see him.

257
00:16:51,833 --> 00:16:52,833
Figured I'd ask.

258
00:16:53,466 --> 00:16:55,466
Want me to show you
around campus some more?

259
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:57,533
Thanks for the offer.

260
00:16:58,333 --> 00:16:59,566
I'll just look around myself.

261
00:16:59,833 --> 00:17:00,833
Mm.

262
00:17:58,259 --> 00:17:59,259
Xiao Mo.

263
00:17:59,733 --> 00:18:00,733
Zhou Yang.

264
00:18:13,726 --> 00:18:14,617
You must be hungry.

265
00:18:14,642 --> 00:18:15,642
Mm.

266
00:18:15,666 --> 00:18:16,533
Let's go eat.

267
00:18:16,566 --> 00:18:17,233
Okay.

268
00:18:17,266 --> 00:18:18,266
Let's go.

269
00:18:27,419 --> 00:18:28,852
They're classmates...

270
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,100
Mr. Ji.

271
00:18:31,101 --> 00:18:32,581
I've looked into Zhou Yang thoroughly.

272
00:18:33,066 --> 00:18:34,066
He...

273
00:18:35,833 --> 00:18:36,833
Go ahead.

274
00:18:37,866 --> 00:18:39,200
He probably has a boyfriend.

275
00:18:39,833 --> 00:18:42,393
I also checked into his boyfriend's
background while I was at it.

276
00:18:43,466 --> 00:18:44,746
Is he a student at T University?

277
00:18:45,266 --> 00:18:46,266
It's all in the file.

278
00:18:46,633 --> 00:18:47,633
Take a look.

279
00:19:16,533 --> 00:19:17,800
Contact the Zhou family.

280
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,700
Okay.

281
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:23,180
I'm going to meet with the Zhou family.

282
00:19:32,233 --> 00:19:33,233
Mr. Ji.

283
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,633
The Zhou Family is here.

284
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,300
Mr. Ji.

285
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:06,300
Come, this way please.

286
00:20:20,066 --> 00:20:22,333
I heard Mr. Ji likes Tieguanyin tea.

287
00:20:22,632 --> 00:20:24,965
So I had someone especially
get some top-grade Tieguanyin.

288
00:20:29,266 --> 00:20:30,866
It really is top-grade Tieguanyin.

289
00:20:31,833 --> 00:20:34,033
Then take some extra with
you when you leave, Mr. Ji.

290
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:36,133
We're family, no need for formalities.

291
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:37,300
Uncle, Auntie.

292
00:20:37,533 --> 00:20:38,800
No need to be so polite.

293
00:20:39,733 --> 00:20:40,733
I'm the younger one here.

294
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,433
Just call me Mingxuan.

295
00:20:42,666 --> 00:20:43,700
Alright then, Mingxuan.

296
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:46,066
Then I'll get straight to it.

297
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:48,533
About Yang and An'an studying abroad.

298
00:20:48,833 --> 00:20:50,565
Didn't we already agree on this?

299
00:20:50,566 --> 00:20:53,400
Why are you saying you
need to think it over again?

300
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:55,700
I think...

301
00:20:57,566 --> 00:20:59,166
it might not be a good idea.

302
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:05,300
This Ji and Zhou family marriage
was already agreed upon.

303
00:21:06,066 --> 00:21:07,766
What's not appropriate about it?

304
00:21:08,833 --> 00:21:11,493
You know well of An'an's condition.

305
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:19,900
Our families aren't strangers.

306
00:21:20,466 --> 00:21:24,372
An'an's situation, your uncle
and I know it all too well.

307
00:21:25,066 --> 00:21:27,800
Besides,
it's not a big deal.

308
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,566
We watched An'an grow up.

309
00:21:30,666 --> 00:21:33,733
Of course we'll be even
more attentive in the future.

310
00:21:34,866 --> 00:21:36,000
Speaking of which.

311
00:21:36,833 --> 00:21:40,466
I was there for your father
and mother's wedding.

312
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,166
It was wonderful.

313
00:21:43,900 --> 00:21:48,059
Your father and mother's union
was truly a beautiful tale in this city.

314
00:21:48,533 --> 00:21:51,800
We hope that Yang and
An'an can be the same.

315
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,200
Actually.

316
00:21:57,666 --> 00:22:00,899
An'an marrying Yang is the best choice.

317
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:02,833
They know each other inside and out.

318
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,733
You'd feel at ease too, wouldn't you?

319
00:22:06,233 --> 00:22:08,566
And you know.

320
00:22:08,659 --> 00:22:14,799
This is the best choice
for the Zhou and Ji families.

321
00:22:16,406 --> 00:22:17,706
Even if An'an is fine with it,

322
00:22:18,779 --> 00:22:20,346
Yang might not be willing.

323
00:22:23,066 --> 00:22:24,066
Mingxuan.

324
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:25,733
What do you mean by that?

325
00:22:26,666 --> 00:22:27,666
As far as I know...

326
00:22:28,633 --> 00:22:31,166
Yang is already seeing someone.

327
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,100
Men, you know.

328
00:22:37,101 --> 00:22:40,100
Having a few girlfriends before
marriage is normal, isn't it?

329
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,900
It's just playing around

330
00:22:42,066 --> 00:22:45,000
I guarantee Yang will
be loyal after marriage.

331
00:22:46,833 --> 00:22:49,700
Yang did date a girlfriend or two.

332
00:22:50,333 --> 00:22:51,866
But they've already broken up.

333
00:22:52,700 --> 00:22:53,833
This current one...

334
00:22:54,900 --> 00:22:56,400
I've never heard him mention it.

335
00:22:57,833 --> 00:22:59,066
He's changed his taste.

336
00:23:00,066 --> 00:23:01,133
He likes men.

337
00:23:01,633 --> 00:23:03,266
Of course he doesn't dare let you know.

338
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:07,566
Mingxuan.

339
00:23:08,866 --> 00:23:11,200
So you had someone look into Zhou Yang.

340
00:23:11,633 --> 00:23:12,633
Of course.

341
00:23:13,466 --> 00:23:15,626
Of course I have to look
out for my sister's happiness.

342
00:23:16,466 --> 00:23:17,466
Anyway.

343
00:23:18,766 --> 00:23:19,833
About going abroad...

344
00:23:21,266 --> 00:23:23,466
Uncle, Auntie, you should
still ask Zhou Yang first

345
00:23:24,300 --> 00:23:25,500
before making a decision.

346
00:23:26,066 --> 00:23:26,766
Oh, come on.

347
00:23:27,066 --> 00:23:28,865
Zhou Yang won't have any objection.

348
00:23:28,866 --> 00:23:29,566
Mingxuan.

349
00:23:29,866 --> 00:23:30,866
Have you eaten yet?

350
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:33,140
I'll have the maid cook
you some of her best dishes.

351
00:23:34,100 --> 00:23:35,900
I appreciate the thought, Uncle.

352
00:23:36,333 --> 00:23:38,733
There's still a pile of things
at the company waiting for me

353
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,133
I really can't get away.

354
00:23:40,233 --> 00:23:41,466
Being busy is a good thing.

355
00:23:41,833 --> 00:23:42,966
We're all family now.

356
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,433
Come by whenever you're free.

357
00:23:45,033 --> 00:23:45,833
I definitely will.

358
00:23:45,866 --> 00:23:46,733
Goodbye, Uncle, Auntie.

359
00:23:46,733 --> 00:23:47,566
Let me walk you out.

360
00:23:47,566 --> 00:23:48,200
Come.

361
00:23:48,233 --> 00:23:49,233
This way.

362
00:23:59,333 --> 00:24:04,166
Look into which slut is
Yang fooling around with for me.

363
00:24:07,766 --> 00:24:09,666
It's all from your side of the family!

364
00:24:10,833 --> 00:24:11,833
Cut from the same cloth.

365
00:24:28,412 --> 00:24:29,645
How long has it been?

366
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,900
Why hasn't the car paint been fixed yet?

367
00:24:32,633 --> 00:24:34,100
Sorry, Mr. Ji

368
00:24:34,233 --> 00:24:35,233
I'll go right now.

369
00:24:45,700 --> 00:24:47,900
Yang, we've lived together so long.

370
00:24:48,459 --> 00:24:50,026
How many times have you cleaned?

371
00:24:50,900 --> 00:24:51,900
Listen.

372
00:24:52,233 --> 00:24:54,000
You have to clean up with me from now on.

373
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,866
Or I'll never cook your
favorite food again.

374
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,000
You hear me?

375
00:25:05,066 --> 00:25:06,066
Xiao Mo.

376
00:25:07,926 --> 00:25:08,693
What's wrong?

377
00:25:08,833 --> 00:25:10,033
You're holding something back.

378
00:25:12,100 --> 00:25:16,056
My... my family said they
want me to study abroad.

379
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:18,333
Which country?

380
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,566
That's great news.

381
00:25:21,972 --> 00:25:23,172
Going abroad to study...

382
00:25:23,500 --> 00:25:24,700
I'd love that myself.

383
00:25:25,333 --> 00:25:26,333
It's just that I...

384
00:25:29,300 --> 00:25:30,300
Then you and I...

385
00:25:33,566 --> 00:25:34,566
Oh, come on.

386
00:25:35,066 --> 00:25:36,266
It's just a different country.

387
00:25:36,833 --> 00:25:38,553
But you're not allowed to find someone else.

388
00:25:38,866 --> 00:25:40,400
I'll be watching you like a hawk.

389
00:25:42,666 --> 00:25:44,333
I'm not that kind of person.

390
00:25:45,333 --> 00:25:49,066
I just feel bad I won't have time for you.

391
00:25:50,233 --> 00:25:51,666
School has breaks too.

392
00:25:51,900 --> 00:25:53,933
Just come back and see me on your breaks.

393
00:25:54,066 --> 00:25:54,733
Ah.

394
00:25:54,734 --> 00:25:56,066
Or I could go visit you.

395
00:25:56,566 --> 00:25:58,100
I've never even been abroad.

396
00:25:58,400 --> 00:25:59,400
Call it a vacation.

397
00:26:02,666 --> 00:26:03,133
Forget it.

398
00:26:03,666 --> 00:26:04,700
Let's drop it.

399
00:26:04,733 --> 00:26:06,066
Nothing's even set in stone yet.

400
00:26:10,333 --> 00:26:11,333
Exactly.

401
00:26:11,633 --> 00:26:13,393
Why worry about things
that may never happen?

402
00:26:15,433 --> 00:26:16,673
It's not like you can run away.

403
00:26:18,133 --> 00:26:19,133
Yeah.

404
00:26:38,633 --> 00:26:39,300
What's up?

405
00:26:39,300 --> 00:26:40,300
You're so happy.

406
00:26:40,712 --> 00:26:41,712
First...

407
00:26:41,866 --> 00:26:43,133
I got my offer from the UK.

408
00:26:43,700 --> 00:26:44,700
Second.

409
00:26:44,933 --> 00:26:46,653
Zhou Yang agreed to come to the UK with me.

410
00:26:49,266 --> 00:26:50,266
Who told you that?

411
00:26:50,733 --> 00:26:51,533
Yang did.

412
00:26:51,733 --> 00:26:52,866
Yang told me.

413
00:26:53,233 --> 00:26:55,865
He said his parents already
worked it out with you.

414
00:26:55,888 --> 00:26:56,888
Isn't that right?

415
00:26:57,493 --> 00:26:58,960
Yang agreed to go abroad too?

416
00:26:59,533 --> 00:27:00,566
Of course.

417
00:27:00,633 --> 00:27:02,233
Why else would he tell me?

418
00:27:04,533 --> 00:27:05,533
Come on, bro.

419
00:27:05,933 --> 00:27:08,233
Can't you just let us
go to the UK together?

420
00:27:10,633 --> 00:27:11,966
You really like Yang that much?

421
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:13,500
I do.

422
00:27:14,500 --> 00:27:18,133
You know that my whole
life there's only ever been him.

423
00:27:19,459 --> 00:27:21,092
And if Yang doesn't like you back?

424
00:27:21,333 --> 00:27:22,573
Then I'll just keep liking him.

425
00:27:22,893 --> 00:27:24,026
As long as I get to see him,

426
00:27:24,066 --> 00:27:25,866
I'll be just so, so happy.

427
00:27:26,566 --> 00:27:29,433
You've got the Ji family curse.

428
00:27:30,266 --> 00:27:31,266
Lovesick fool.

429
00:27:34,133 --> 00:27:35,766
So you too, huh bro?

430
00:27:36,433 --> 00:27:37,633
I'm really curious.

431
00:27:37,893 --> 00:27:40,226
What kind of person
could make you fall in love?

432
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:43,933
If Zhou Yang and that Shen
Mo are just playing around,

433
00:27:44,233 --> 00:27:45,833
and if he treats An'an well from now on,

434
00:27:46,733 --> 00:27:47,973
even if it's just humoring her,

435
00:27:48,433 --> 00:27:49,873
if he can keep it up for a lifetime,

436
00:27:50,340 --> 00:27:51,700
then it's not out of the question.

437
00:27:53,433 --> 00:27:54,433
Aw, bro.

438
00:27:54,633 --> 00:27:56,066
Are you gonna let us go or not?

439
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,100
Please please please.

440
00:27:58,633 --> 00:27:59,633
Alright.

441
00:27:59,766 --> 00:28:01,000
It'll be just as you wish.

442
00:28:02,233 --> 00:28:03,233
Yay!

443
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,400
An'an.

444
00:28:08,633 --> 00:28:09,673
My precious little sister.

445
00:28:10,466 --> 00:28:12,466
All you need to do is dress up pretty.

446
00:28:13,133 --> 00:28:15,133
And stay a princess in the castle forever.

447
00:28:16,033 --> 00:28:19,126
You don't need to worry
about the storm outside.

448
00:28:27,933 --> 00:28:29,866
Yang agreed to go abroad with An'an.

449
00:28:30,866 --> 00:28:32,233
I was just about to report to you.

450
00:28:32,766 --> 00:28:34,800
I don't know why he suddenly gave in.

451
00:28:35,466 --> 00:28:37,900
Maybe your last visit to
the Zhou Family worked.

452
00:28:38,733 --> 00:28:39,933
What did the Zhou Family do?

453
00:28:41,533 --> 00:28:42,733
That I don't know.

454
00:28:42,833 --> 00:28:44,432
But it looks like Yang

455
00:28:44,433 --> 00:28:46,233
must have broken up with that guy.

456
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,400
Okay.

457
00:28:49,066 --> 00:28:50,186
Let's leave it here for now.

458
00:29:02,100 --> 00:29:02,633
Big Bro.

459
00:29:02,833 --> 00:29:04,733
Once I'm there, I'll miss you.

460
00:29:05,300 --> 00:29:06,766
If you miss me, just fly back.

461
00:29:07,133 --> 00:29:08,166
If it's too much hassle

462
00:29:08,233 --> 00:29:09,532
I'll fly over to you.

463
00:29:09,533 --> 00:29:10,233
Really?

464
00:29:10,266 --> 00:29:11,333
You said it.

465
00:29:17,633 --> 00:29:19,033
Take good care of An'an over there.

466
00:29:19,666 --> 00:29:20,666
I will.

467
00:29:21,066 --> 00:29:22,200
Don't worry, Bro.

468
00:29:22,766 --> 00:29:23,100
Mm.

469
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:25,066
Then we're off.

470
00:29:25,466 --> 00:29:26,466
Mm.

471
00:29:27,300 --> 00:29:28,300
Let's go.

472
00:29:30,100 --> 00:29:31,100
Bye.

473
00:29:54,503 --> 00:29:56,503
[Shen Mo's dossier]

474
00:30:11,300 --> 00:30:12,300
Hello?

475
00:30:12,333 --> 00:30:13,066
Oh.

476
00:30:13,100 --> 00:30:14,100
It's me.

477
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:17,133
That person you had me look into last time.

478
00:30:18,033 --> 00:30:19,433
Send someone to keep an eye on him.

479
00:30:19,933 --> 00:30:21,233
Is something wrong, Mr. Ji?

480
00:30:21,433 --> 00:30:21,766
Oh.

481
00:30:22,333 --> 00:30:23,333
Nothing major.

482
00:30:23,866 --> 00:30:25,066
Just watch him for a few days.

483
00:30:26,829 --> 00:30:28,683
[Assistant]

484
00:30:31,066 --> 00:30:31,866
Hello?

485
00:30:31,866 --> 00:30:32,500
What's wrong?

486
00:30:32,733 --> 00:30:33,733
Mr. Ji.

487
00:30:33,766 --> 00:30:35,686
The person you told me
to watch has gone missing.

488
00:30:36,033 --> 00:30:37,066
When did that happen?

489
00:30:37,700 --> 00:30:39,409
I went to find him as
soon as you gave the order.

490
00:30:39,433 --> 00:30:41,153
But I haven't been able to find him at all.

491
00:30:41,433 --> 00:30:42,466
What should we do now?

492
00:30:42,633 --> 00:30:43,633
What else can we do?

493
00:30:43,900 --> 00:30:45,066
Go find him, of course.

494
00:30:46,433 --> 00:30:47,566
Send more people to search.

495
00:30:48,133 --> 00:30:49,293
If that fails, call the cops.

496
00:30:49,566 --> 00:30:50,566
Yes.

497
00:30:56,300 --> 00:30:58,433
Yang just took Ji An'an abroad

498
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,566
and now something's happened to Mo.

499
00:31:01,466 --> 00:31:02,966
Who else could've done it?

500
00:31:04,900 --> 00:31:05,900
The Zhou Family.

501
00:31:07,233 --> 00:31:08,500
You people are ruthless.

502
00:31:10,333 --> 00:31:11,333
But if...

503
00:31:12,433 --> 00:31:14,633
I never had anyone investigate Shen Mo...

504
00:31:40,333 --> 00:31:41,333
Hello?

505
00:31:41,466 --> 00:31:41,933
Mr. Ji.

506
00:31:42,233 --> 00:31:43,233
We found him.

507
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:13,466
Mr. Ji.

508
00:32:13,733 --> 00:32:15,166
It might not look good inside.

509
00:32:20,233 --> 00:32:21,233
It doesn't matter
